("ArticleFeature","molécula","ArticleFeature","molecule","ui","—","PhotoFrame, Badge, Icon; Surface recipe","mover","Implemented React molecule under [approved v0.1 contract](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/280): whole-card anchor (native `a` or `asChild` Slot) with a reserved 16:8 cover (generative well + `aria-hidden` word, or `PhotoFrame ratio=\"auto\"`), optional brand badge, context row, generated heading and paint-only action label; `ListItem` anchor hover treatment. No halo, isotype mark, stylesheet, ref or nested action."),
