("CommunityCard","molécula","CommunityCard","molecule","ui","—","Surface, Button; consumer-supplied mark slot","mover","Implemented React molecule under [approved v0.1 contract](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/281): community article with a `surface-2` header band (public `Text` eyebrow role line + consumer named-or-decorative mark slot), generated display heading, free copy and one supplied `Button`/`Link` pinned with `mt-auto`. No avatar, wordmark artwork, stylesheet, ref or card-level interaction."),
("—","—","Carousel","molecule","ui","— (native scroll and bounded roving focus)","IconButton, Icon, ProgressBar, VisuallyHidden","extraer","Implemented React molecule under [approved v0.1 contract](https://github.com/egdev6/egdev-design-system/issues/80): manually navigated read-only slides with stable string identities, bounded direction-aware keyboard navigation, native scrolling and background/media mouse dragging. Controlled requests wait for acceptance; settled user changes coordinate focus and polite status. Structural layout only; consumer Surface content owns Material. No autoplay, stylesheet, new dependencies or legacy TipsSlider migration."),
